From: Luma UI maintainers <noreply@projectluma.org>
Subject: [PATCH] Match phone list cells and metadata to v71

The desktop metadata rule fixes direct cell labels at 11px/500, so changing
row typography cannot update phone dates. Use the shared 13px body metrics
on phone metadata labels. Align column allocation, row margins and cell
padding to one 12px inset, leaving desktop columns intact.

--- a/src/resources/style.css
+++ b/src/resources/style.css
@@ -1338,5 +1338,26 @@
 window.luma-files-window .nautilus-list-view.phone-list:not(.search-results) columnview > listview > row {
   min-height: 54px;
   font-size: 15px;
   font-weight: 500;
 }
+window.luma-files-window .nautilus-list-view.phone-list:not(.search-results) .nautilus-view-cell > label.dim-label {
+  font-size: var(--lumaui-t-body-size);
+  font-weight: var(--lumaui-t-body-weight);
+  letter-spacing: var(--lumaui-t-body-tracking);
+}
+
+window.luma-files-window .nautilus-list-view.phone-list:not(.search-results) columnview > listview > row {
+  margin-left: 12px;
+  margin-right: 12px;
+}
+window.luma-files-window .nautilus-list-view.phone-list:not(.search-results) .nautilus-view-cell {
+  padding: 0 12px;
+}
+window.luma-files-window .nautilus-list-view.phone-list:not(.search-results) columnview {
+  padding-left: 12px;
+  padding-right: 12px;
+}
+window.luma-files-window .nautilus-list-view.phone-list:not(.search-results) columnview > listview {
+  margin-left: -12px;
+  margin-right: -12px;
+}
